    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d504">

                <pb facs="0545" n="533" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg533"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.2221/495: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Vice Consul at
                        Barcelona</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Flood</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-30T18:00:00-04:00">July 30, 1937—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 29th, 11 a.m. [Here follows passport information for the four Americans
                    arrested near Barcelona.] Since authorities offer to release these men to you
                    for evacuation before ordering their formal incarceration, you are authorized to
                    issue special certificates of identity for travel to Marseille<anchor n="86"
                        xml:id="d504-f1"/> only setting forth above facts in evidence of American
                    citizenship. Advise Consul Marseille to take these certificates up and to issue
                    passports to these men valid only immediate return to United States upon
                    execution affidavit setting forth in detail circumstances of recruitment,
                    obtention of passport, <pb facs="0546" n="534" xml:id="pg534"/> use of passport
                    and service in Spanish Army. Passports should be delivered purser of ship and
                    Department advised sailing by cablegram. If funds are needed for repatriation
                    advise Department names and addresses of relatives and it will endeavor to
                    obtain them.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d504-f1" n="86" xml:id="d504-f1-content">
                <p>The Consul General at Marseille on August 7 reported the arrival of these four
                    men (852.2221/502).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
